  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "d85756d9-e1d4-4bb6-8e33-420a8f01a80d",
    "name": "Starfish Space Website Content API (WordPress REST v2) Search API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The public WordPress REST API served by Starfish Space at https://www.starfishspace.com/wp-json/wp/v2. Starfish Space is a Tukwila, Washington satellite-servicing company building the Otter spacecraft; this API is the content interface behind starfishspace.com (news/press releases, pages, media, taxonomies), not a spacecraft, telemetry or mission-data API. Read operations are available anonymously; write operations require an authenticated WordPress user.\n\nThis document was DERIVED by API Evangelist from documents the API itself publishes: the machine-readable route index at /wp-json/wp/v2 and the item JSON Schemas returned by HTTP OPTIONS on each collection route. No paths, parameters or schema properties were invented.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Starfish Space",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
  }
